🚣
"Row Your Boat"/en
=== start/en
¶Row, Row, Row Your Boat — one time through, ten seconds exactly, with a
little fleet rowing to it.

The song is in 6/8, so each bar is six eighth notes and every entry in these
lists is one of them. Twenty-four beats at 144 beats a minute comes to ten
seconds on the nose.

The boats are driven by @Beat rather than by a clock, so they pull on the
music's beat instead of merely near it — and they hold still until it starts,
because @Beat stays on beat zero until then.¶

beat: Beat()
stroke: beat.count

¶The tune. Row row row your boat, gently down the stream — the long notes are
long because the rests after them hold the grid, since every entry lasts the
same eighth.¶
melody: [
	1 ø ø 1 ø ø
	1 ø 2 3 ø ø
	3 ø 2 3 ø 4
	5 ø ø ø ø ø
	8 8 8 5 5 5
	3 3 3 1 1 1
	5 ø 4 3 ø 2
	1 ø ø ø ø ø
]

¶A chord at the top of each bar. It stays home the whole way until the second
to last bar, which leans on the fifth so the last bar feels like an arrival.¶
chords: [
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
	{5 7 9 11} ø ø
	{1 3 5} ø ø
]

¶The stroke: a low hit to pull on and a bright one to recover, once per bar.¶
oars: [
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
	1 ø 3
]

¶A boat. It slides a little further along on every beat and rocks the other
way each time, which is what reads as rowing; the lane sets how high it sits
and how far ahead it started, so they don't move as one.¶
ƒ boat(lane•# start•#)•Phrase
	Phrase(
		'🚣'
		1.5m
		place: Place(
			((((stroke + start) % 16) - 8) · 1.1) · 1m
			((lane · 1.9) - 1.9) · 1m
		)
		rotation: (((stroke + lane) % 2) = 0) ? 9° -9°
		duration: 0.2s
	)

fleet: [boat(0 0) boat(1 6) boat(2 11)]

🎭(
	[
		:fleet
		💬('〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️〰️' 1m place: Place(-8m -3.2m) color: Color(48% 22 240°))
		💬('Row, row, row your boat' 0.9m place: Place(-4.4m 3.4m))
		🎼(
			[
				🎶(melody instrument: 🔈.🪈 beat: 0.5beats)
				🎶(chords instrument: 🔈.🎹 beat: 1beats volume: 60%)
				🎶(oars instrument: 🔈.🥁 beat: 1beats volume: 45%)
			]
			tempo: 144beats/min
			name: 'boat'
		)
	]
	background: Color(22% 18 230°)
	color: Color(96% 0 0°)
)
